Description: Add .js extensions to relative imports
 twig-lexer 1.0.0 is compiled to CommonJS and extensionless imports such as
 "./Token" resolve there. This package ships native ES modules, where Node
 requires the full specifier, so the shipped lexer files import "./Token.js".
 TypeScript resolves the .js specifier to the .ts source at compile time.
Author: Numiko
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
Twig-Reference: none (port fix, no behaviour change)
Test: npm run typecheck (TS2835 without this patch); npm run test:upstream
Last-Update: 2026-09-23
---
diff --git a/src/main/lib/Lexer.ts b/src/main/lib/Lexer.ts
